with the decimal exponent `1 - 1/10^13` replaced by `decimalExponentL3945H = 1 - 17581520/10^10`
(Work/FourierL3945H/Goal.lean). Sibling of the Walsh-Hadamard theorem `wht_main_block_L3945Hx`: both
